'''Lugercane''' is a [[godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Old Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Lugercane has a red and white stripe pattern, resembling the look of a candy cane. It has a metal-style handle. It resembles a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luger_pistol Luger Pistol].

==Trivia==
*It is a reskin of [[Luger]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun.
*Other Christmas Lugers are [[Ginger Luger]], [[Green Luger]], and [[Red Luger]], making [[Lugercane]], the fourth Christmas [[Luger]] and sixth [[Luger]] reskin.
*It partners with the godly knife [[Eternalcane]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Eternalcane Set|Eternalcane Set]].
*Lugercane is one of the many candy-cane themed godlies (Others being [[Minty]], [[Eternalcane]], [[Peppermint]], [[Candy]] and [[Sugar]]).
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/95354288/Luger-Pistol Luger Pistol], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux. However, the texture has been altered to a different color scheme.

